{"type":"assistant","uuid":"849a7b1e-0046-4210-903f-2dc20c6cf5fd","session_id":"eacf48c8-9f5f-4c3e-9596-5ebe50424ae9","message":{"id":"849a7b1e-0046-4210-903f-2dc20c6cf5fd","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Now I understand the task. I need to implement the \"任务系统设置\" (Task System Settings) feature. Looking at the acceptance criteria:\n\n1. 用户可修改基础设置，保存后刷新页面仍保持设置值。\n2. 设置项会影响对应功能默认行为，如列表排序、分页数量和默认优先级。\n3. 非法设置值被拦截并恢复为安全默认值。\n4. 关键操作（设置保存、设置读取、非法设置拦截、默认值回退）有详细调试日志输出（含时间戳、操作类型、关键参数、结果状态），便于后续问题排查。\n\nSo the settings system needs:\n- default_sort_field\n- default_sort_order\n- default_page_size\n- default_priority\n- reminder_lead_time (提醒提前时间)\n\nI need to:\n1. Add functions to read/write these settings from SQLite\n2. Create a settings UI in the frontend\n3. Make the settings affect the actual behavior\n4. Add validation and debug logging\n\nLet me look at how the current defaults are used and where the settings UI should be.","signature":""}],"model":"minimax-m2.7","role":"assistant","stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"type":"message","usage":{"input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":0,"cache_creation_input_tokens":null,"cache_read_input_tokens":null,"cache_creation":null,"server_tool_use":null,"service_tier":null}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"__timestamp":"2026-06-01T03:57:37.689Z","_requestId":"a8e0b3f3c43743b1b62656910799ac4c"}

